y":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-12T07:48:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T07:55:14Z","closed_at":"2025-07-12T07:54:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.5.beta3.official [4d1f26e1f]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe instance uniforms from a main shader, affecting next pass instance uniforms.\nFor example, changing an albedo parameter in the following shader:\n\n```\nshader_type spatial;\n\nstencil_mode write, compare_always, 1;\n\ninstance uniform vec3 albedo;\n\nvoid vertex() {\n\tCOLOR.rgb = albedo;\t\n}\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tALBEDO = COLOR.rgb;\n}\n```\n\naffects the `outline_strength` parameter of outline shader at the next pass:\n\n```\nshader_type spatial;\n\nrender_mode blend_mix, depth_draw_opaque, cull_back, diffuse_burley, specular_schlick_ggx, unshaded;\nstencil_mode read, compare_not_equal, 1;\n\ninstance uniform float outline_strength = 0.0;\ninstance uniform vec4 outline_color : source_color = vec4(0, 0, 0, 1);\n\nvoid vertex() {\n\tVERTEX += NORMAL * outline_strength;\n}\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tALBEDO = outline_color.rgb;\n\tALPHA = outline_color.a;\n}\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5f4f87a-7f84-4f7c-b396-65de209d366d)\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n^^\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[TestOutlineBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21194699/TestOutlineBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108542/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108542/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}